th one Malibu when you can have two? Last racing season, 256 took Malcolm Storey's Malibu and made the Black Mamba. Eric and Brant came across another Malibu they can build into a twin G-body, and want to see which of the two is faster.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-01\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"A Mustang's Second Chance\",\"overview\":\"Eric has been called to rescue an 06' Mustang that was top of the line in its heyday, but has been sitting in a garage for a decade since. Brant wants help with his new Camaro, but the use of resources with the Vega race approaching has priorities split.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-08\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Making Up Takes a Braveheart Camaro\",\"overview\":\"While the 256 team works effortlessly to build a vega from stock Brant has taken his new camaro to his own shop. With a big race coming up involving the whole team, will Eric and Brant find a way to make amends and bring the team back together?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-05\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Vegas's Swan Song\",\"overview\":\"The freshly painted Vega is finally ready for testing, but they need to get it down the track in under five seconds in order to beat James Rowlette and his Boost of Burden Mustang. The teams have agreed to go head to head to see who takes the new Vega.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-12\",\"runtime\":45}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-09-30\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}